{
  "short_id": "short292",
  "episode_id": "PD-2026-071-oroville",
  "voice_stage": "master",
  "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
  "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
  "estimated_cost_usd": 0.276,
  "total_seconds": 53.6,
  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-071-oroville\\06_voice\\master\\short292_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "The obvious guess is that they lost because you cannot sue a state government. That is wrong. They could and they did.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.548,
      "seconds": 6.548,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6e87814c669af19a1581c8d0aa1a6cf9b0b8f5376cf286b33f0bd9f4e0e3d930"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The Department of Water Resources argued that a mandatory evacuation had not really been binding. There is no penalty for staying.",
      "start": 6.768,
      "end": 14.059,
      "seconds": 7.291,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:c030e795fec88898a7f89237646336d76b50f06c4f765009ceca91996441ac15"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "That was argued. It is on the record. And it is not what the court decided.",
      "start": 14.279,
      "end": 18.644,
      "seconds": 4.365,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:c7d547850bc7014fdd2dc7404015894d96e57532d3ab479c4c956888ec79e68c"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "In fact, the evidence and briefing demonstrated there was no defined mandatory evacuation zone, and no defined group to which an order was issued.",
      "start": 18.864,
      "end": 26.759,
      "seconds": 7.895,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:8c45ca0d969b5a655671a158f8799522686f539fdc83fc9e8dee7b9968acbe21"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "No defined zone. Not a zone that was drawn too widely, or drawn in the wrong place, or drawn and then lost. There was never a zone.",
      "start": 26.979,
      "end": 35.385,
      "seconds": 8.406,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:25d5e37fffa046be6e41c9cf36ab46f02a402f7a3761f705e636c6e834ce380a"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The orders did not describe a specific area, but rather such vague areas as: the low levels of Oroville and areas downstream.",
      "start": 35.605,
      "end": 43.314,
      "seconds": 7.709,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:92768e691bab41bd01bed4e5fc5c3294fb52b6abb76caa6a1200e7053b2f7476"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The instinctive picture of a mandatory evacuation is a map with a line on it, and a list of streets inside the line.",
      "start": 43.534,
      "end": 49.525,
      "seconds": 5.991,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:d413f66f27f1a057867d9ca270d5291bded4c779c32a2d11b1596f854e261dc7"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "What the court found in the evidence was that no such line had ever been drawn.",
      "start": 49.745,
      "end": 53.6,
      "seconds": 3.855,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:d2f2583582582f09ec8b28a7d72e9ed2e252f2f5b1230658b16d6f08c9208fbb"
    }
  ]
}
